 "convocatoria": "Reserva 1",
 "documento": null,
 "ejercicios": [
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2020-reserva-1-1",
   "n": 1,
   "bloque": "",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Calcula \\(a\\) sabiendo que \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to0}\\left(\\frac1{\\ln(1-x)}-\\frac{ax-1}x\\right)=\\frac72\\) (\\(\\ln\\) denota la función logaritmo neperiano).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Reducir a un cociente",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(\\dfrac1{\\ln(1-x)}-\\dfrac{ax-1}x=\\dfrac{x-(ax-1)\\ln(1-x)}{x\\ln(1-x)}=\\dfrac{N(x)}{D(x)}\\), con \\(N(0)=0\\) y \\(D(0)=0\\): \\(\\tfrac00\\). L'Hôpital<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de L'Hôpital: si \\(N(x_0)=D(x_0)=0\\) y existe \\(\\lim\\frac{N'}{D'}\\), entonces \\(\\lim\\frac ND=\\lim\\frac{N'}{D'}\\).</i>:</p>\\[N'(x)=1-a\\ln(1-x)-\\frac{1-ax}{1-x}\\ \\Rightarrow\\ N'(0)=0\\qquad D'(x)=\\ln(1-x)-\\frac x{1-x}\\ \\Rightarrow\\ D'(0)=0\\]</div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Segunda aplicación",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>De nuevo \\(\\tfrac00\\):</p>\\[N''(x)=\\frac a{1-x}-\\frac{1-a}{(1-x)^2}\\ \\Rightarrow\\ N''(0)=2a-1\\qquad D''(x)=-\\frac1{1-x}-\\frac1{(1-x)^2}\\ \\Rightarrow\\ D''(0)=-2\\]\\[\\frac{2a-1}{-2}=\\frac72\\iff2a-1=-7\\iff a=-3\\]<div class='res'>\\(a=-3\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación con desarrollos: \\(\\frac1{\\ln(1-x)}=-\\frac1x+\\frac12+\\dots\\), y \\(-\\frac{ax-1}x=-a+\\frac1x\\); el límite es \\(\\frac12-a=\\frac72\\Rightarrow a=-3\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "lim",
     "apartados": ""
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": null
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "revisado"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2020-reserva-1-2",
   "n": 2,
   "bloque": "",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=\\dfrac{-x^3+2x-3}{x^2-x}\\) para \\(x\\neq0\\), \\(x\\neq1\\). Halla la primitiva de \\(f\\) cuya gráfica pasa por el punto \\((2,3\\ln2)\\), donde \\(\\ln\\) denota la función logaritmo neperiano.",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "División y fracciones simples",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Grado 3 sobre grado 2: divido<i class='n' data-t='why'>Con grado(numerador) \\(\\ge\\) grado(denominador) se divide primero.</i>: \\(-x^3+2x-3=(x^2-x)(-x-1)+(x-3)\\), luego</p>\\[f(x)=-x-1+\\frac{x-3}{x(x-1)}\\qquad\\frac{x-3}{x(x-1)}=\\frac Ax+\\frac B{x-1}\\iff x-3=A(x-1)+Bx\\Rightarrow A=3,\\ B=-2\\]</div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Integración y condición",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[F(x)=-\\frac{x^2}2-x+3\\ln|x|-2\\ln|x-1|+C\\]<p>Por \\((2,3\\ln2)\\): \\(F(2)=-2-2+3\\ln2-0+C=3\\ln2\\Rightarrow C=4\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(F(x)=-\\dfrac{x^2}2-x+3\\ln|x|-2\\ln|x-1|+4\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "integ",
     "tipo": "racional",
     "apartados": ""
    },
    {
     "tema": "integ",
     "tipo": "pcond",
     "apartados": ""
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": null
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "revisado"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2020-reserva-1-3",
   "n": 3,
   "bloque": "",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&1\\\\1&a&b\\\\c&1&4\\end{pmatrix}\\), \\(B=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\\) y \\(C=\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\2\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\\). Determina \\(a\\), \\(b\\) y \\(c\\), sabiendo que \\(AB=C\\) y la matriz \\(A\\) tiene rango 2.",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(AB\\) es la suma de cada fila de \\(A\\): \\(\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\1+a+b\\\\c+5\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\2\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow a+b=1\\) y \\(c=-4\\).</p><p>\\(\\operatorname{rg}A=2\\) exige \\(|A|=0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Una matriz \\(3\\times3\\) de rango 2 tiene determinante 0 (y algún menor \\(2\\times2\\) no nulo).</i>; lo calculo por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&1&1\\\\1&a&b\\\\-4&1&4\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(4 a- 4 b+1\\bigr)-\\bigl(- 4 a+b+4\\bigr)\\]\\[=8a-5b-3=0\\]<p>Con \\(b=1-a\\): \\(8a-5+5a-3=0\\Rightarrow13a=8\\Rightarrow a=\\frac8{13}\\), \\(b=\\frac5{13}\\). El rango es 2 (las filas 1 y 2 no son proporcionales).</p><div class='res'>\\(a=\\dfrac8{13}\\), \\(b=\\dfrac5{13}\\) y \\(c=-4\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
