  {
   "id": "matematicas-2020-reserva-1-4",
   "n": 4,
   "bloque": "",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera el tetraedro de vértices \\(A(0,0,0)\\), \\(B(1,1,0)\\), \\(C(0,1,3)\\) y \\(D(1,0,3)\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Calcula el volumen de dicho tetraedro.",
     "(1,5 p.) Calcula la medida de la altura trazada desde el vértice \\(A\\) de dicho tetraedro."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Calculo el producto mixto por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[[\\overrightarrow{AB},\\overrightarrow{AC},\\overrightarrow{AD}]=\\begin{vmatrix}1&1&0\\\\0&1&3\\\\1&0&3\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(3+3+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(0+0+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=6\\]\\[V=\\frac16\\bigl|[\\overrightarrow{AB},\\overrightarrow{AC},\\overrightarrow{AD}]\\bigr|=\\frac16\\cdot6=1\\]<div class='res'>\\(V=1\\ u^3\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>La altura trazada desde \\(A\\) es la distancia de \\(A\\) al plano \\(\\pi\\) que contiene a la cara \\(BCD\\), es decir, la distancia de \\(A\\) a su proyección ortogonal \\(H\\) sobre ese plano<i class='n' data-t='why'>El camino más corto de un punto a un plano es el segmento perpendicular al plano.</i>.</p><p><b>Plano \\(BCD\\).</b> Con \\(\\overrightarrow{BC}=(-1,0,3)\\) y \\(\\overrightarrow{BD}=(0,-1,3)\\), el vector normal es perpendicular a ambos:</p>\\[\\vec n=\\overrightarrow{BC}\\times\\overrightarrow{BD}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\-1&0&3\\\\0&-1&3\\end{vmatrix}=(3,\\,3,\\,1)\\]<p>El plano es de la forma \\(3x+3y+z+D=0\\) y como contiene a \\(B(1,1,0)\\): \\(3+3+0+D=0\\iff D=-6\\).</p>\\[\\pi\\equiv3x+3y+z-6=0\\]<p><b>Paso 1. Recta perpendicular a \\(\\pi\\) por \\(A\\).</b> Como la recta y el plano son perpendiculares, el vector normal del plano es paralelo al director de la recta:</p>\\[s\\equiv\\begin{cases}x=3t\\\\y=3t\\\\z=t\\end{cases}\\]<p><b>Paso 2. Punto de corte \\(H\\).</b> Sustituyo en \\(\\pi\\):</p>\\[9t+9t+t-6=0\\iff19t=6\\iff t=\\frac6{19}\\]\\[\\Rightarrow\\ H\\left(\\frac{18}{19},\\,\\frac{18}{19},\\,\\frac6{19}\\right)\\]<p><b>Paso 3. Distancia.</b></p>\\[h=|\\overrightarrow{AH}|=\\frac6{19}\\,|(3,3,1)|=\\frac6{19}\\sqrt{19}=\\frac6{\\sqrt{19}}\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":0,\"el\":8,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[1,1,0],[0,1,3],[1,0,3]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"line\",[0,0,0],[1,1,0],\"#64748b\",1.4,false],[\"line\",[0,0,0],[0,1,3],\"#64748b\",1.4,false],[\"line\",[0,0,0],[1,0,3],\"#64748b\",1.4,false],[\"line\",[0,0,0],[0.947,0.947,0.316],\"#16a34a\",2.0,true],[\"line\",[0.775,0.775,0.258],[0.816,0.816,0.015],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[0.816,0.816,0.015],[0.988,0.988,0.072],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"pt\",[0,0,0],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[1,1,0],\"B\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,1,3],\"C\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[1,0,3],\"D\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0.947,0.947,0.316],\"H\",7,12]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='n506n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='n506d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='n506g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='n506r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='99.3,246.0 99.3,18.0 26.0,28.2' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='26.0' y1='235.8' x2='99.3' y2='246.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.4'/><line x1='26.0' y1='235.8' x2='99.3' y2='18.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.4'/><line x1='26.0' y1='235.8' x2='26.0' y2='28.2' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.4'/><line x1='26.0' y1='235.8' x2='95.5' y2='222.5' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.0' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><line x1='82.8' y1='224.9' x2='85.8' y2='243.0' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='85.8' y1='243.0' x2='98.4' y2='240.6' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><circle cx='26.0' cy='235.8' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='33.0' y='229.8' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='99.3' cy='246.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='106.3' y='240.0' font-weight='700'>B</text><circle cx='99.3' cy='18.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='106.3' y='12.0' font-weight='700'>C</text><circle cx='26.0' cy='28.2' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='33.0' y='22.2' font-weight='700'>D</text><circle cx='95.5' cy='222.5' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='102.5' y='234.5' font-weight='700'>H</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='272.2' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='277.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='40.0' y2='270.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='42.6' y='274.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='254.2' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='252.6' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(210.0,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(h=\\dfrac6{\\sqrt{19}}=\\dfrac{6\\sqrt{19}}{19}\\approx1{,}376\\) unidades</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación con el volumen: \\(V=\\frac13\\,\\text{Área}(BCD)\\cdot h\\), con \\(\\text{Área}(BCD)=\\frac12|(3,3,1)|=\\frac{\\sqrt{19}}2\\): \\(h=\\frac{3\\cdot1}{\\sqrt{19}/2}=\\frac6{\\sqrt{19}}\\) ✓. Además \\(C\\) y \\(D\\) cumplen \\(3x+3y+z-6=0\\) (\\(0+3+3-6=0\\), \\(3+0+3-6=0\\)) ✓.</i></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
